CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,FIn an emergency visit to Stourbridge,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has referred to Britain
OL,8,Fas a "tinderbox", as he scrambled to
OL,9,Frespond to the summer heatwave and
OL,10,Fwildfires.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister revealed he planned
OL,13,Fto commission firefighting planes, as
OL,14,Fused to douse flames in Europe and the
OL,15,FUSA, to combat the spread of "major
OL,16,Fincident" wildfires in the West
OL,17,FMidlands and across Britain.
OL,19,FHe said the country has to "face up"
OL,20,Fto the "changing climate" and needs to
OL,21,Ftransition to "more clean energy".
OL,26,@pD@FOUpD@PO]{D@\OU{D@dO]|D@HOU|D@YO]}D@
OL,26,AOOU}D@aO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,FAdding: "We might be in for a wet
OL,7,Fautumn and winter straight after this,
OL,8,Fbecause of El Nino and some of the
OL,9,Fissues there, which was reported to
OL,10,FCobra. So, after fire could come
OL,11,Ffloods."
OL,13,FMr Burnham said plans were being drawn
OL,14,Fup for emergency financial support for
OL,15,Ffire services battling the spread of
OL,16,Fwildfires.
OL,18,FSpeaking as he visited houses in
OL,19,FStourbridge which had been destroyed
OL,20,Fby wildfire, the Prime Minister said:
OL,26,@nD@IOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,F"I've never seen scenes like this in
OL,7,FBritain, where you just see a whole
OL,8,Fhouse gutted, smouldering."
OL,10,FHe added "Britain is a tinderbox right
OL,11,Fnow" with "37 fires smouldering around
OL,12,Fthe country".
OL,14,FMr Burnham acknowledged that aerial
OL,15,Ffirefighting capabilities would help
OL,16,Fand they would be commissioned
OL,17,Fnationally for use around the country.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@[O]rD@JOUsD@DO]sD@KOUtD@LO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,FHe promised a summit with fire
OL,7,Fservices as he acknowledged they had
OL,8,Fnot been given the funding needed to
OL,9,Fcope with the impact of climate change
OL,10,F` including the possibility of floods
OL,11,Flater in the year.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,FHe went on to say: "I can't say today
OL,7,Fthat we've done enough to fully
OL,8,Fresource them to deal with these type
OL,9,Fof incidents, and I want our
OL,10,Ffirefighters to know that I understand
OL,11,Fhow it seems from their point of view,
OL,12,Fand I'm going to convene that summit
OL,13,Fto make sure we get in place the right
OL,14,Fsupport, including the aerial support,
OL,15,Fpermanently if that is what they deem
OL,16,Fis needed".
OL,18,F"Obviously, there's other adjustments
OL,19,Fthat we need to make in relation to
OL,20,Fclimate change."
OL,26,@nD@TOUzD@AOU|D@PO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,FHe said experts had warned the UK
OL,7,Fcould face a wet autumn and winter
OL,8,Fbecause of the El Nino effect "so,
OL,9,Fafter fire could come floods".
OL,11,FThe Prime Minister also said he was in
OL,12,Ftouch with local leaders in the West
OL,13,FMidlands as firefighters continue to
OL,14,Fbring several wildfires in the region
OL,15,Funder control.
OL,26,@pD@_OUqD@]O]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,FHe said in a statement yesterday
OL,7,F(Thursday 18 August): "My thoughts are
OL,8,Fwith everyone affected, particularly
OL,9,Fthose who have been injured or forced
OL,10,Ffrom their homes, and with the
OL,11,Ffirefighters who have been taken to
OL,12,Fhospital.
OL,14,F"I'm in touch with local leaders
OL,15,F(including West Midlands Mayor Richard
OL,16,FParker) and will be speaking to
OL,17,Femergency services on the ground as
OL,18,Fthey continue their response.
OL,26,@oD@WOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/8
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1786816101
OL,3,CPrime Minister pledges to deploy
OL,4,Cmilitary to tackle Stourbridge fires
OL,6,F"Our firefighters are working in
OL,7,Fincredibly difficult conditions and
OL,8,Fputting themselves at risk to keep
OL,9,Fothers safe. A huge thank you to them
OL,10,Fand everyone supporting the effort
OL,11,Ftonight.
OL,13,F"Please stay safe and follow their
OL,14,Fadvice."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUvD@HO]
